    "measurementTechnique": [
      "The dataset was created via a process of inviting contributed data to be submitted following defined reporting formats and provided metadata templates. Data types included in the database are leaf gas exchange measurements, paired with leaf reflectance data. Leaf traits included maximum carboxylation rate of rubisco (Vcmax), the maximum electron transport rate (Jmax), and dark respiration (Rdark). Additional trait data was also collected where available, including leaf nitrogen, leaf mass per area (LMA), and leaf water content (LWC). The data processing workflow uses R codes to import and clean data, and fit photosynthetic parameters. Following import and compilation of the data, PSLR (partial least squares regression) methods were used to fit the leaf traits and the spectral reflectances, building predictive models for each trait. See the GitHub content in this dataset, and the related reference paper for complete Methods."
    ],
